  "title": "Weekly Update 530: Email Dependencies & Apps",
  "url": "https://www.troyhunt.com/weekly-update-530/",
  "content": "<img alt=\"Weekly Update 530: Email Dependencies &amp; Apps\" src=\"https://storage.ghost.io/c/fb/33/fb3391dc-723d-4e74-b95a-d641b5feb38e/content/images/2026/11/maxresdefault.jpg\" /><p>Email is just one of those utilities like power or water where you always expect it to just, well, to just be there. You sign up with a provider and use as much of it as you need, when you need it, and the idea of it being unavailable for any extended period of time is foreign. Microsoft&apos;s outage a few days ago was one of those exceptional circumstances, and whilst it absolutely rocked the whole internet, it&apos;s far from a reason not to decry using email for most of the things we currently apply it to. But it <em>is</em> a good time to look at where redundancy makes sense; maybe start with redundant channels for <a href=\"https://www1.wdr.de/nrw/rheinland/rhein-erft-kreis/technischer-defekt-chlor-phantasialand-100.html?ref=troyhunt.com\" rel=\"noreferrer\">alerts about things that could hurt people</a>!</p>\n<!--kg-card-begin: html-->\n<div><div style=\"width: 170px; display: inline-block; margin-right: 3px;\"><a href=\"https://itunes.apple.com/au/podcast/troy-hunts-weekly-update-podcast/id1176454699?ref=troy-hunt\"><img alt=\"Weekly Update 530: Email Dependencies &amp; Apps\" src=\"https://storage.ghost.io/c/fb/33/fb3391dc-723d-4e74-b95a-d641b5feb38e/content/images/2018/05/Listen-on-Apple-Podcasts.svg\" /></a></div><div style=\"width: 175px; display: inline-block; margin-right: 3px;\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL7LAAxaabizMAXnJe0s3xjQ30q12EVmjt&amp;ref=troyhunt.com\"><img alt=\"Weekly Update 530: Email Dependencies &amp; Apps\" src=\"https://storage.ghost.io/c/fb/33/fb3391dc-723d-4e74-b95a-d641b5feb38e/content/images/2024/09/Watch-and-Listen-on-YouTube.svg\" /></a></div><div style=\"width: 118px; display: inline-block; margin-right: 3px;\"><a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/show/7jMtKFohdrw6qmz8AkLqit?ref=troy-hunt\"><img alt=\"Weekly Update 530: Email Dependencies &amp; Apps\" class=\"kg-image\" src=\"https://storage.ghost.io/c/fb/33/fb3391dc-723d-4e74-b95a-d641b5feb38e/content/images/2019/10/spotify.svg\" /></a></div><div style=\"width: 120px; display: inline-block;\"><a href=\"https://omny.fm/shows/troy-hunt-weekly-update/playlists/podcast.rss?ref=troy-hunt\"><img alt=\"Weekly Update 530: Email Dependencies &amp; Apps\" src=\"https://storage.ghost.io/c/fb/33/fb3391dc-723d-4e74-b95a-d641b5feb38e/content/images/2018/07/Download-via-RSS.svg\" /></a></div></div>\n<!--kg-card-end: html-->"
